---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Disclaimer"
  description="AlbionForge terms of use and disclaimer: unofficial fan tool, no warranty on calculations, Albion Online is a trademark of Sandbox Interactive."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> › Terms &amp; Disclaimer</div>
  <section class="section prose">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="lead">The short version: free fan tool, no warranty, not affiliated with the game's maker.</p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      AlbionForge provides profit calculators for entertainment and planning purposes. All results
      are <strong>estimates based on the numbers you enter and the game constants cited on the
      <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a></strong>. Game mechanics change with patches;
      market prices change by the minute. We make no guarantee that any calculated result reflects
      what happens in game, and we are not liable for in-game or real-money losses incurred by
      relying on this tool. Verify important decisions in game.
    </p>

    <h2>Unofficial fan tool</h2>
    <p>
      AlbionForge is an unofficial, fan-made website. Albion Online and all related names and
      assets are trademarks of Sandbox Interactive GmbH. This site is not affiliated with,
      sponsored by, or endorsed by Sandbox Interactive. No game assets are hosted here.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of the site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The site is free; no accounts, subscriptions or payments exist.</li>
      <li>All computation runs in your browser; see the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li>You may use, quote and link to the site freely; please attribute “AlbionForge” with a link.</li>
      <li>Don't misrepresent the site as official, or use it to claim guarantees about game outcomes.</li>
    </ul>

    <Ornament />
    <p class="small">
      Questions or corrections: <a href="/about/">contact details</a> ·
      <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
